      "message": "40 (#118)\n\n* bumping version\n\n* Some changes for 2026.40 (#117)\n\n* Add special character stripping for search queries\n\n* Implement back navigation handling for LockActivity\n\n* Add Easter egg to unlock counter in LockActivity\n\n* move easter eggs translations to the end\n\n* cleaning\n\n* Replacing clock by h1 and moving the other headers to the next size\n\n- adding dimens for each font size\n\n* adding missing styles from theme\n\n* settings dracula as the default theme\n\n* optimizing color picker\n\n* allowing theme on brand\n\n* preventing non letter for been the initial of the profiles\n\n* add zoom controls\n\n* fixing ui scale unit\n\n* fix apps moving when group was deleted\n\n* updating video\n\n* Update video.txt\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: İsmail TİRYAKİ <179320252+isotjs@users.noreply.github.com>",
