      "message": "38 (#109)\n\n* bumping version\n\n* Adding Themes (#110)\n\n* removing old apks from the repo\n\n* adding themes section\n\n* setting theme controllers\n\n* adding cappuccin theme\n\n* making sure the mako logo takes the current theme colors\n\n* adding dracula, tokyo night and melange dark\n\n* adding theme right after the font was applied\n\n* updating changelog\n\n* cleaning\n\n* updating attributions\n\nadding themes section\n\n* replacing button pin color for bg tertiary\n\n* renaming colors\n\n* updating the get color to work with api 21\n\n* using themes color for monochrome icons\n\n* adding custom xml for context menu\n\n* applying font manager on theme manager\n\n* separating foreground from icon color\n\n* separating clock color from foreground\n\n* split mako into two themes\n\n* adjusting dracula theme\n\n* adding custom theme form\n\n* adding theme prefs and save theme button\n\n* wiring theme-form with current theme\n\n* adjusting mako and rama themes\n\n* subtracting translations\n\n* refactoring themes / adding themes design\n\n* add keyboard navigation fixes\n\n* renaming variables and adjusting theme form visibility\n\n* fixing text color theme override\n\n* update changelog\n\n* removing amoled and dynamic color in favor of the custom theme background and form // part 1\n\n* part 2\n\n* Adding color picker (#112)\n\n* adding color picker ui\n\n* replace rest of the color picker buttons for a custom widget\n\n* color picker dialog\n\n* Adding color picker selectors\n\n* removing hardcoded strings from color picker\n\n* fixing the type of color pickers\n\n* radio and checkboxes not taking the theme\n\n* update changelog\n\n* Font selection (#114)\n\n* Adding font selector\n\n* toggle custom font input visibility\n\n* feat: add Discord server link to About activity and documentation (#113)\n\n* feat: add Discord server link to About activity and documentation\n\n* fix merge conflict\n\n* custom font shouldnt open immediately it should let the user read\n\nCo-authored-by: İsmail TİRYAKİ <179320252+isotjs@users.noreply.github.com>",
