      "message": "36 (#95)\n\n* bumping version\n\n* reorganizing settings (#96)\n\n* reorganizing settings\n\n* removing conditional visibility for wallpaper button\n> the wallpaper is always present in the OS even if is not visible when the launcher is on. it's used to recalculate the material-you colors and it can be seem when you are displaying all the open apps.\n\n* fixed bug where searchbar was not reset when opening app (#93)\n\n* Pin code (#98)\n\n* adding pin-field\n\n* adding lock screen ui\n\n* randomized pin\n\n* wiring the lock screen\n\n* preventing lock to show multiple times\n\n* mako launcher -> mako\n\n* Changed formatting of string resources for german language (#101)\n\n* changed formatting of string resource for language german\n\n* added missing language strings for language german\n\n* Add changelog",
