      "message": "34 (#64)\n\n* hiding  collapsible indicator when unused\n\n* Enhance wallpaper theming and improve wallpaper rendering performance (#67)\n\n* Wallpapers and theme stuff\n\n* fix: performance fixes for wallpaper\n\n* preventing wallpaper from bleeding into the settings\n\n* feat: add option to always show search bar\n\n* merge conflicts\n\n* preventing search bar word repeatition in the search section\n\n* updating prefs\n\n* adding contributors\n\n* first steps to move the app from pomboverso to rama-io\n\n* bumping version\n\n* removed outdated line from branding\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: İsmail TİRYAKİ <ismailtiryaki2021@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: etwasmitbaum <47484288+etwasmitbaum@users.noreply.github.com>",
