      "committedAt": "2026-04-11T22:25:39+00:00",
      "message": "33 (#56)\n\n* beginning of version 33\n\n* Docs (#58)\n\n* adding docs\n\n*  branding guidelines\n\n* adding negative/monochrome icon\n\n* adding navigation among documents\n\n* adding new contributor to the list\n\n* updating jersey font\n\n* updating readme\n\n* Delete FUNDING.yml\n\n* Bunch of new features (#55)\n\n* updated gitignore.\n\n* fix: onback register\n\n* refactor: search\n\n* fix: onback action for search\n\n* fix: app cache for better performance\n\n* add: added an option to switch to *C on settings.\n\n* add: custom app icons.\n\n* separating content from titles in pick-dialog-*\n\n* preventing the modal to overgrow when the list is limited\n\n* adding some space between list and navigation buttons\n\n* fix: ux changes for settings ui.\n\n* fix: I forgot to remove show_icons from kt :(\n\n* add: fuzzy search\n\n* redesign: redesigned the entire settings screen.\n\n* lowering haptic intensity\n\n* expanding all the settings groups for default\n\n* adding collapsible sections widget\n\n* organizing settings layout\n\n* cleaning prefs\n\n* adjusting collapsible headers\n\n* preventing the select icon modal to show inmediatley\n\nit is the next step but the user needs to read what is happening before opening the modal\n\n* Split settings activity (#61)\n\n* splitting settings activity\n\n* removed duplication\n\n* auditing the app with ai\n\n* standarizing default system label\n\n* refactoring colors\n\n- fixing unsorted groups showing everywhere\n\n* adding contrast in the icon between foreground and background\n\n* adding contributors to about page\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: İsmail TİRYAKİ <ismailtiryaki2021@gmail.com>",
