      "docs/attributions.md": {
        "binary": false,
        "truncated": false,
        "patch": "diff --git a/docs/attributions.md b/docs/attributions.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..0d0b288\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/docs/attributions.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@\n+# Attribution\n+\n+## Project\n+\n+Privacy-first Android launcher designed for focus, speed, and simplicity.\n+\n+Built entirely in native Kotlin, runs fully on-device, avoids tracking, and keeps distractions to a minimum by emphasizing clarity and intentional interaction.\n+\n+- Original author: [Pombo](https://github.com/pomboverso)\n+- Original repository: https://github.com/pomboverso/mako\n+- License: **GPL 3.0**\n+- License link: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0\n+---\n+\n+## Contributors\n+\n+- [Pombo](https://github.com/pomboverso)\n+- [isotjs](https://github.com/isotjs)\n+  - Search UX improvements\n+  - Fixed back navigation behavior (prevented unintended app close by properly handling navigation stack)\n+  - Added temperature unit support (Celsius, Fahrenheit, and system default)\n+  - Custom app icon support improvements\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Font Attribution\n+\n+This project uses the **Jersey 25** font from the Soft Type Collection.\n+\n+- Font name: **Jersey 25**\n+- Author: [Sarah Cadigan-Fried](https://github.com/scfried)\n+- Source: https://github.com/scfried/soft-type-jersey\n+- License: **OFL 1.1**\n+- License link: https://openfontlicense.org\n+\n+The SIL Open Font License 1.1 is included in the project and applies to the font files.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Icon Attribution\n+\n+Icons used in this project:\n+\n+- Icon set: **pixel-icon-library**\n+    - Author: [HackerNoon](https://github.com/hackernoon)\n+    - Source: https://github.com/hackernoon/pixel-icon-library\n+    - License: **CC 4.0**\n+    - License link: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\n+\n+---\n+\n+[Go Back To Readme](../readme.md)\n\\ No newline at end of file\n"
      },
      "docs/branding.md": {
        "binary": false,
        "truncated": false,
        "patch": "diff --git a/docs/branding.md b/docs/branding.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..ee219c5\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/docs/branding.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,75 @@\n+# Branding\n+\n+This document defines the official visual assets and usage guidelines for Mako.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Header\n+\n+![Mako Header](./img/mako_header_1280x630.svg)\n+\n+Standard header image for social previews and repository sharing.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Header (TV)\n+\n+![Mako Header TV](./img/mako_tvBanner_1280x720.svg)\n+\n+Optimized for TV and wide-screen displays.\n+\n+## Feature Graphic\n+\n+![Mako Header TV](./img/mako_featureGraphic_1024x500.svg)\n+\n+Feature graphic on f-droid.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Icon\n+\n+### Foreground (Fill)\n+\n+![Mako Icon Fill](./img/mako_icon_fill.svg)\n+\n+Primary icon version using solid fill.\n+\n+---\n+\n+### Foreground (Negative)\n+\n+![Mako Icon Negative](./img/mako_icon_negative.svg)\n+\n+This version is designed for use on dark or colored backgrounds.\n+\n+The negative variant can be used with any background color.  \n+For demonstration purposes, green is used to showcase visibility in both light and dark markdown\n+previews.\n+\n+---\n+\n+### Icon Outline\n+\n+![Mako Icon Negative Outline](./img/mako_icon_outline.svg)\n+\n+Outline variant for minimal or subtle UI contexts.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Icon Background\n+\n+`#305F4A`\n+\n+Primary background color used behind the icon when needed.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Usage Notes\n+\n+- Do not distort, rotate, or alter the proportions of the assets.\n+- Maintain sufficient contrast between the icon and its background.\n+- Prefer the fill version for primary branding and the negative/outline versions for contextual use.\n+\n+---\n+\n+[Go Back To Readme](../readme.md)\n\\ No newline at end of file\n"
      },
